  "query_preview": "..\n\nKEY MESSAGE 1) \n\nA light northerly breeze will continue through tomorrow as a coastal\nlow lingers well to our east while surface high pressure is centered\nover the upper Midwest. The high will slowly shift overhead on \nTuesday and to our east Wednesday. Return flow around the high will \noffer a short period of above normal temperatures starting mid-week\nand continuing until a cold front moves into the Ohio Valley on\nFriday. The front will produce a chance of showers and storms late \nThursday and Friday.",
